{"story":{"id":"site-the-host","title":{"zh":"地下洞穴","en":"Subterranean Hollows"},"category":"precursors","kind":"site","image":"art/4b9a54996bf0e131c65f.webp","start":"archaeological_site_types:the_host","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"在这颗星球的地壳内，数量惊人的地下通道系统交错盘旋。究竟是什么造就了这一切呢？","en":"An extensive network of subterranean tunnels of truly astounding proportion make swirls in the crust of this planet. What could have created them?"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:the_host","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"ancrel.2070","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1855"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.2071","parent":"n2","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"ancrel.2072","parent":"n3","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"archaeological_site_types:the_host","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"地下洞穴","en":"Subterranean Hollows"},"texts":[{"zh":"在这颗星球的地壳内，数量惊人的地下通道系统交错盘旋。究竟是什么造就了这一切呢？","en":"An extensive network of subterranean tunnels of truly astounding proportion make swirls in the crust of this planet. What could have created them?"}],"sections":[{"zh":"在这颗星球的地壳内，数量惊人的地下通道系统交错盘旋。究竟是什么造就了这一切呢？","en":"An extensive network of subterranean tunnels of truly astounding proportion make swirls in the crust of this planet. What could have created them?"}],"image":"art/4b9a54996bf0e131c65f.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.2070","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1855","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"sto