"group":"r29683","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:26","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-8065"},{"target":"ancrel.8070","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29683","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:29","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-8070"},{"target":"ancrel.8075","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0007,"group":"r29683","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:35","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-8075"},{"target":"ancrel.8080","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29683","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:36","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-8080"},{"target":"ancrel.8110","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29683","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:37","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-8110"},{"target":"federations2.701","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29683","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:51","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-federations2-701"},{"target":"ancrel.4078","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0018,"group":"r29683","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:64","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-4078"},{"target":"ancrel.13030","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29683","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:71","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-13030"},{"target":"ancrel.4006","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0071,"group":"r29683","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:90","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-4006"},{"target":"ancrel.4021","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0071,"group":"r29683","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:104","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-ancrel-4021"}],"source":{"file":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt","line":1820}},{"id":"ancrel.2070","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"地下巨兽","en":"Subterranean Giant"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们的考古学家在[From.Planet.GetName]上出土了相当数量的螺旋状空管片段，得出的结论是它们是某只巨蠕虫的化石！经碳14测定，这一外星生物生活在大约一千万年前，它像一只巨大的穴居千足虫一样缓慢地钻入该星球地壳。\n\n更值得注意的是，这些宏伟的生物化石中嵌入的许多东西似乎是人造物。这些东西主要发现于化石的躯干部位，看起来像是某种体型较小、会使用工具的外星人建造的居所。\n\n进一步的考古工作是必要的。","en":"Our archaeologists have unearthed enough sections of the tube-like, swirling hollows on [From.Planet.GetName] to conclude that they are the fossilized remains of an enormous arthropod! This alien creature, carbon-dated to having lived some ten million years ago, tunneled slowly through the crust of the planet, like a burrowing millipede of incredible proportions.\n\nEven more remarkably, many of the components embedded in the magnificent creature's fossilized remains appear to be of artificial origin. These imprints, found primarily within the main body segment of the creature, look like habitations built by smaller, tool-using aliens.\n\nFurther archaeological efforts are warranted."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/ed5834af7a2302717b7e.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"INTRIGUING","label":{"zh":"有意思。","en":"Intriguing."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.2071","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt","hooks":["stage"],"story":"site-the-host"}],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","line":3271}},{"id":"ancrel.2071","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"失落城镇","en":"Lost Boroughs"},"texts":[{"zh":"对[From.Planet.GetName]上的巨型地下蠕虫化石内的人造物的大范围考古工作已经证实这确实是一座城市的遗迹！这个城市由数十万个高约一米、会使用工具的生物组成，建在巨蠕虫的肠道内。目前尚不清楚这些生物是如何找到在巨蠕虫体内生存的方式的，但他们那处于青铜—石器混用时期的社会似乎在其的消化道内经历了数千年的蓬勃发展。\n\n如果我们希望进一步了解这个社会的兴亡历史，并尽可能多地收集关于其宿主死亡原因的信息，就需要进行进一步的研究。","en":"Extensive excavation of the fossilized imprints within the giant subterranean arthropod remains on [From.Planet.GetName] have confirmed these are indeed the remnants of a city! Populated by hundreds of thousands of meter-tall, tool-using creatures, this city was constructed within the very bowels of the gigantic arthropod. It is unknown how these creatures found their way inside of this subterranean giant, but their pre-Bronze Age society seemed to flourish for thousands of years within its digestive tract.\n\nFurther study is required if we wish for further insight into this society's history and downfall -- and perhaps glean more about the death of their host."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b2b01e67d3cf3780beb3.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"ASTOUNDING","label":{"zh":"令人震惊。","en":"Astounding."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.2072","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt","hooks":["stage"],"story":"site-the-host"}],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","line":3290}},{"id":"ancrel.2072","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"宿主","en":"The Host"},"texts":[{"zh":"经过对大量化石的精密分析，结合之前意外发现的文字记录，我们的考古学家们已经就[From.Planet.GetName]上原始文明与他们所寄生的巨蠕虫之间的关系得出研究结论。\n\n虽然城市居民对其巨蠕虫宿主的肠液有很强的抵抗力，但持续暴露在宿主消化道中虽温和但依然有化学腐蚀性的气体中会大大缩短他们的寿命。随着医学发展和科技发展，居民逐渐意识到他们实际上生活在一只更大的生物的消化道内。这些人之后便发动了一场惨烈的战争，武装了城市里的每一个成员，试图摧毁这个生物。\n\n但这一切都是徒劳的。巨蠕虫肠道内的变故使其剧烈蠕动，导致整个文明的居民被反刍到巨蠕虫的胃里。随后，整个城市的居民迅速被宿主胃里腐蚀性更强的胃酸所溶解。\n\n此蠕虫在千年以后，单纯因年老而死去了。","en":"After painstaking analysis of a large number of fossils and a few miraculous finds of early writing, our archaeologists have reached a conclusion regarding the relationship between the primitive civilization on [From.Planet.GetName], and the gigantic arthropod that was home to them.\n\nWhile the city-dwellers were largely resistant to the intestinal fluids of their arthropoid host, constant exposure to the still mildly chemically corrosive gases of the host's digestive tract vastly shortened their lifespans. Owing to their discovery of medicine and the scientific process, the citizens became aware they were in fact living within the digestive chamber of a much larger creature. The citizens then launched a magnificent war, arming every member of the city in an attempt to destroy the creature.\n\nBut it was all for naught. The turmoil in the arthropod's lower gut led to severe peristalsis, resulting in the entire civilization of tiny city-dwellers being regurgitated up into the arthropod's stomach. Subsequently, the entire populace was promptly dissolved by their host's virulent stomach acids.\n\nThe creature itself perished millennia later, from simple old age."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/7455fb245eff77f8b3dd.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"ancrel.2072.a.swarm","label":{"zh":"这一切真是鼓舞人心。","en":"Inspirational."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":true,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}},{"type":"identity","key":"origin_evolutionary_predators","value":false,"label":{"zh":"演化猎手","en":"Evolutionary Predators"}}]]},{"key":"ancrel.2072.a","label":{"zh":"真是可怕。","en":"Gruesome."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"ancrel.2702.b.evopred","label":{"zh":"但愿我们的微生物永远不会演化至此。","en":"Let's hope our own microbiome never evolves that far."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"origin_evolutionary_predators","value":true,"label":{"zh":"演化猎手","en":"Evolutionary Predators"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","line":3309}}]}